# Tests for subset.sem: every invariant of `checkDeclarations`,
# `checkOperation`, `checkModule`, and `diagnose` is verified below, on a small
# module of records, enums, and a list, on the squares sample
# (samples/squares/squares.sem), and on copies of it changed one row at a time.

declareTest is test
declareTest purpose "Built-in and declared types are numbered, members kept in order, and every target entered with its slots"
declareTest verifies checkDeclarations declaresTypes
declareTest verifies checkDeclarations declaresTargets
declareTest typeParameter none
declareTest input none
declareTest output none
declareTest outputOwnedBy none
declareTest raises none
